  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cyber Capacity Center for Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&#x2019;s planned effect on society is improved national cybersecurity awareness and posture in the Southern Africa region (Impact).
The planned effects for the target group of the Project are increased Cybersecurity Capacity Maturity of SADC countries, improved efficacy of existing capacity resources; greater stakeholder collaboration and representation; and a global cybersecurity debate more informed by and reflecting the African context. (Outcome).</narrative>
  </description>
